    "query": "What is a corporation?",
    "answer": "A corporation is a company or group of people authorized to act as a single entity (legally a person) and recognized as such in law. A shareholder or stockholder is an individual or institution (including a corporation) that legally owns one or more shares of stock in a public or private corporation. Legally, a person is not a shareholder in a corporation until his or her name and other details are entered in the register of shareholders.",
